OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric boatyard awarded #4.5m
OL,4,Aheritage funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FA historic working boatyard in
OL,7,FShropshire has been awarded #4.5m
OL,8,Ftowards restoration and development
OL,9,Fwork.
OL,11,FEarlier this year, the Canal and River
OL,12,FTrust applied to Shropshire Council to
OL,13,Fchange the use of some of the buildings
OL,14,Fat Ellesmere Yard into offices, craft
OL,15,Funits, shops, visitor areas and
OL,16,Feducation spaces.
OL,18,FThe yard on the Llangollen Canal opened
OL,19,Fin 1806, and has been a key part of the
OL,20,Fregion's canal maintenance network
OL,21,Fsince its establishment, the trust
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
