OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric boatyard awarded #4.5m
OL,4,Aheritage funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiz Bates, from The National Lottery
OL,7,FHeritage Fund, which has provided the
OL,8,Ffunding, said it will help to maintain
OL,9,Fthe site as a working yard and will
OL,10,Fsupport the trust "to sustain this for
OL,11,Fmany more years to come".
